      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "OSINT Recon",
      "questDescription": "Samira asks you to plan the opening reconnaissance for Neon Vault within its bug-bounty scope. Choose a public-source starting point, then use the OSINT Framework directory to identify tools for file metadata and public domain or contact discovery. Selecting a tool does not mean you have run it or confirmed a finding.",
